> Is your updated version showing icons? If not, it's a must have to keep in the new version

`const renderMenu = option => {
  if (option.type !== 'seperator') {
    return (
      <MenuItem>
        {option.renderIcon && (
          <ListItemIcon>{option.renderIcon()}</ListItemIcon>
        )}
        {option.value}
      </MenuItem>
    );
  } else {
    return <Divider />;
  }
};`

`renderOption={(option, state) => renderMenu(option)}`

I have added this code now and it renders the icon :)

